<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fullautomated Sandminer for the Summervent on Grand RP</Major>
    <Description>This script is a fully automatic farming script for the currently available summer event on GrandRP. With this script 500 sand are farmed fully automatically, which are then craftet in sand castles to make room for the next load of sand. While collecting, every time after 50 sand is collected, the Anti AFK part runs through to avoid going into sleep mode, which causes you to not be able to collect sand in that mode. The shovel is aligned to the shortcut key 4. 

The mouse positions are set in WQHD (2,560 x 1,440) resolution and if you want to run the script on a different resolution, you have to adjust them for that resolution.

</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 33 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 33 1
Delay 6000 ms
GoWhile 1 49
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 64 ms
GoWhile 1 9
KeyDown 12 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 12 1
Delay 500 ms
MoveTo 2210 67
Delay 64 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 300 ms
MoveTo 474 530
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 300 ms
MoveTo 1820 1041
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 300 ms
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 300 ms
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>